9. Deployment Checklist

☐ F_CPU_HZ set to the actual core clock
☐ WCET_CYCLES matches the architectural budget (800)
☐ D-cache disabled, or all hot data in DTCM/ITCM
☐ MPU regions configured: ROM read-only, DTCM read-write, stack guarded
☐ fis_rule_table[] in ROM, not RAM
☐ All ternary vectors pass ternary_validate() before use
☐ FSM_TICK_HARDWARE set correctly for the build (0 = reference, 1 = silicon)
☐ Hardware cycle counter wired to the FSM if FSM_TICK_HARDWARE=1
☐ tile_power_off() called on every exit path
☐ WFI in the idle loop
☐ Determinism test passes 1000× per input
☐ WCET test passes on target silicon
☐ Hallucination test: 10,000 out-of-domain queries all return ERR_AMBIG
☐ SK-1024 signature verification active on every sovereign update

