Appendix C — Common Mistakes

Mistake Consequence Fix
Enabling D-cache Non-deterministic WCET Disable, or use TCM
Wrong F_CPU_HZ All timing derived from it is wrong Verify against the clock tree
Using hash() from libc Randomized per process (Python) or implementation-defined (C) Use FNV-1a or SHA
Software tick + hardware tick both active Double-counted cycles Set FSM_TICK_HARDWARE correctly
No WFI in idle loop Full active power while "idle" Add __asm__ volatile ("wfi")
Skipping ternary_validate() Both-planes-set values silently corrupt results Always validate
Running under an RTOS without suspending AET WCET guarantee is void Bare metal for certified use

